# Build-context allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include exactly what
# docker/Dockerfile.finn reads. The dependency layers use only pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock and src/finn/util/external.py; the release stage also builds wheels from
# the sources below.
*

!docker/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!setup.py
!setup.cfg
!MANIFEST.in
!VERSION
!README.md
!LICENSE.txt
!src/
!packages/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/*.egg-info/
**/.git
